# PR draft vs ready for review

**Default:** create pull requests as **Draft** (early visibility, branch CI, WIP commits). **Draft = do not review** — implementation, verification, or acceptance work may still be in flight.

Mark **Ready for review** only when you would ask a teammate to review **now**: stated scope is done, you self-reviewed the diff, title/description and test plan are complete, CI is green (or failures are explained), and (when applicable) demo/BDD/acceptance gates are met. Ready means **approvals and merge hygiene** are the main remaining gates.

**Before Ready:** run **[obsidian-pr-ship-sync](../../skills/obsidian-pr-ship-sync/SKILL.md)** in the same turn as demo completion so title, description, embedded media, and **`## Acceptance review`** match **shipped code and the latest recording**:

1. **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** — full body + artifacts + acceptance evidence.
2. **`ManagePullRequest` `update_pr`** — **`draft: false`** only after step 1.

Do not mark Ready with stale copy or **Verdict: PASS** tied to old clips. After substantive post-review changes or merge-conflict fixes, **convert back to Draft**, then **Ready** again ([GitHub stage docs](https://docs.github.com/en/pull-requests/collaborating-with-pull-requests/proposing-changes-to-your-work-with-pull-requests/changing-the-stage-of-a-pull-request)).

## Checklist before Ready

| Gate | Ready when |
|------|------------|
| Scope | Goal implemented; no hidden pre-merge TODO unless called out in the description |
| Diff | Full self-review; body explains **what** and **why** |
| Tests / CI | Repo `typecheck` / `test` / `build` green on the PR branch |
| Deploy | Sandbox/cloud Obsidian verify done when the change runs in-app (not local-only when cloud is available) |
| UI / behavior | When [pr-product-demos](./pr-product-demos.mdc) applies: embedded cloud demo, visibility + jank, **`/ui-verifier-demo`** when [trigger-ui-verifier-demo](./trigger-ui-verifier-demo.mdc) applies, then **`/pr-acceptance-review`** with **Verdict: PASS** ([obsidian-pr-acceptance-review](../../skills/obsidian-pr-acceptance-review/SKILL.md)) |
| PR ship sync | Body, embeds, and acceptance section match **this** branch and **this** demo ([obsidian-pr-ship-sync](../../skills/obsidian-pr-ship-sync/SKILL.md)) |
| Size | Large PRs: description tells reviewers where to start; split if unfair to review |

**Lighten** for docs-only, zero-behavior dependency bumps, or explicit **`/no-test`** — still state what was verified in the PR body.

## Human verify (maintainer)

Do **not** ask the maintainer to verify or merge until the PR is **Ready**, acceptance review **PASS** when required, and merge conflicts/CI are clean.

**Note:** GitHub **draft release** (release workflow) is unrelated to **draft pull request** — see [obsidian-plugin-dev](../../skills/obsidian-plugin-dev/SKILL.md) release notes.

